{"vid":"WoevJbp7Iz4","source":"WoevJbp7Iz4.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":6.6,"txt":"So with tell me about yourself when"},{"t":8.5,"txt":"you're thinking about what is the best"},{"t":9.8,"txt":"way to answer this question one format"},{"t":11.8,"txt":"that I always lean towards which is"},{"t":13.8,"txt":"going to be the [music] present past"},{"t":15.7,"txt":"future format. You start with a present"},{"t":17.6,"txt":"statement. What are you doing right now?"},{"t":19.8,"txt":">> Okay."},{"t":20.4,"txt":">> What have you done in the past? Tell me"},{"t":22.2,"txt":"about the years of relevant experience"},{"t":23.8,"txt":"that you have. Maybe it's your"},{"t":25,"txt":"education. Maybe it's a past couple of"},{"t":27,"txt":"roles. Maybe it's a project that you did"},{"t":29.4,"txt":"that was super relevant you want to call"},{"t":31.2,"txt":"back to. But what's really valuable is"},{"t":33.4,"txt":"going to be the future statement."},{"t":35,"txt":">> So this is where you're able to kind of"},{"t":36.6,"txt":"tie it all together and really focus on"},{"t":39,"txt":"how this role is relevant in your career"},{"t":41.8,"txt":"journey and more specifically how"},{"t":44.5,"txt":"[music] you see yourself really thriving"},{"t":46.8,"txt":"at this company because of something"},{"t":48.4,"txt":"you've learned about them. [music]"},{"t":51.2,"txt":">> One of the most common questions that"},{"t":52.9,"txt":"you're going to be asked, what are some"},{"t":54.1,"txt":"of your strengths or some of your"},{"t":55.4,"txt":"weaknesses? This is a tricky one for me"},{"t":57.2,"txt":"and I know a lot of people say it's"},{"t":58.6,"txt":"tricky for them as well."},{"t":59.8,"txt":">> Really, when we structure these answers,"},{"t":61.8,"txt":"we want to identify a relevant weakness."},{"t":64.5,"txt":"We never want it to be a weakness that"},{"t":66.6,"txt":"is [music] debilitating to the point"},{"t":68.4,"txt":"where we wouldn't be able to complete"},{"t":69.6,"txt":"the job at hand."},{"t":71,"txt":">> But if you'll notice with all of these"},{"t":72.6,"txt":"structured responses, it's really"},{"t":74,"txt":"focusing on [music] what are we doing to"},{"t":75.6,"txt":"improve, right? What strategies are we"},{"t":77.7,"txt":"trying? Because that means that of"},{"t":79.9,"txt":"course we're human. We all have"},{"t":81.2,"txt":"weaknesses, but we recognize these"},{"t":83,"txt":"things in ourselves. And so these are"},{"t":84.6,"txt":"things that we're trying to hopefully"},{"t":85.9,"txt":"get a little bit better every single"},{"t":87.4,"txt":"day."},{"t":88,"txt":">> Just about how you frame it."},{"t":91.4,"txt":"First, [music] make sure all your tech"},{"t":93.4,"txt":"is working the day before. This includes"},{"t":96.1,"txt":"camera, microphone, meeting platform"},{"t":98.3,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":98.9,"txt":"like Google Meet or Zoom, and your"},{"t":101,"txt":"internet connection. 15 to 30 minutes"},{"t":103,"txt":"before your interview, check your"},{"t":104.7,"txt":"connection and make sure you're able to"},{"t":106.1,"txt":"sign [music] in. Turn on the sound and"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"video to ensure everything is in working"},{"t":110,"txt":"order in time for your conversation."},{"t":112,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":112.6,"txt":"Wear professional attire. Dress the same"},{"t":114.8,"txt":"as you would in a face- to-f face"},{"t":116.2,"txt":"interview. No distractions. Choose a"},{"t":118.9,"txt":"quiet location with a clean background."},{"t":120.6,"txt":"Try to place your [music] device on a"},{"t":122,"txt":"table or desk. Build rapport. Be"},{"t":124,"txt":"prepared to talk about a common interest"},{"t":125.8,"txt":"or find some other neutral topic to"},{"t":127.8,"txt":"learn more about your interviewer. And"},{"t":129.6,"txt":"don't forget to practice answering"},{"t":131.4,"txt":"common interview questions. [music]"},{"t":134.7,"txt":"What are some red flag answers to some"},{"t":138.2,"txt":"of these questions that you would ask"},{"t":139.6,"txt":"during an interview? any [music] red"},{"t":141.2,"txt":"flag is going to be something that's"},{"t":142.9,"txt":"contradictory to what they have in the"},{"t":145.3,"txt":"job description. So, for example, if"},{"t":147.9,"txt":"you're looking at a role and it seems"},{"t":149.9,"txt":"like a pretty fixed schedule and then"},{"t":151.5,"txt":"you ask what does a typical week look"},{"t":153.2,"txt":"like and they say you should expect to"},{"t":155.8,"txt":"work 50 hours a week [music] or on"},{"t":157.8,"txt":"weekends. We expect everybody to be on"},{"t":160.2,"txt":"call. If that's not what you're looking"},{"t":162.3,"txt":"for in a role and that's a different"},{"t":163.8,"txt":"picture than what they paint in the job"},{"t":165.1,"txt":"description, [music] that would"},{"t":166.2,"txt":"absolutely be a red flag for you."},{"t":170.8,"txt":"interviews are literally so"},{"t":172.7,"txt":"nerve-wracking. This person holds your"},{"t":174.9,"txt":"[music] whole future in their hands. My"},{"t":177.4,"txt":"tips are put myself up, you know, with"},{"t":180.6,"txt":"music. Obviously, being prepared is"},{"t":183,"txt":"something that's really important, but"},{"t":184.5,"txt":"also realizing that that person's a"},{"t":186.3,"txt":"person, too. They're not like super"},{"t":188.2,"txt":"human. They're just another person that"},{"t":189.8,"txt":"you're chatting with."},{"t":190.9,"txt":">> They're just another person."},{"t":192.5,"txt":">> How can you overcome interview anxiety?"},{"t":194.5,"txt":"[music] I think interview anxiety can be"},{"t":196.6,"txt":"overcome with a lot of preparation. And"},{"t":199.3,"txt":"that preparation can really start before"},{"t":201.4,"txt":"the interview actually [music] takes"},{"t":202.7,"txt":"place. You'll hear me talk about this a"},{"t":204.6,"txt":"lot. I really am a proponent of"},{"t":206.6,"txt":"practicing common interview questions."},{"t":208.8,"txt":"Honestly, if you can just get down a"},{"t":210.6,"txt":"solid answer to tell me about yourself,"},{"t":212.4,"txt":"you're going to be in a really good"},{"t":213.9,"txt":"spot. Also, read that job description."},{"t":217,"txt":"really get comfortable with knowing what"},{"t":218.8,"txt":"[music] they're looking for because"},{"t":220.3,"txt":"that's going to help you and make you"},{"t":222.1,"txt":"feel really confident when you're giving"},{"t":223.8,"txt":"answers. And [music] then if you're in"},{"t":225.9,"txt":"the interview, don't be afraid to"},{"t":228.3,"txt":"acknowledge your nervousness. I know"},{"t":230.1,"txt":"sometimes people don't want to say it"},{"t":232.6,"txt":"out loud because it feels like they're"},{"t":234.2,"txt":"drawing attention to it, but it's very"},{"t":236.4,"txt":"humanizing to just say, \"Hey, I'm"},{"t":239.1,"txt":"feeling a little nervous right now, but"},{"t":240.7,"txt":"it's just [music] because I'm really"},{"t":241.9,"txt":"excited about this opportunity.\" It's"},{"t":244.2,"txt":"showing vulnerability and you can be"},{"t":247.6,"txt":"vulnerable and confident at the same"},{"t":249.8,"txt":"time."},{"t":251.5,"txt":"[music]"},{"t":252,"txt":">> Actually have a viewer perspective on"},{"t":253.5,"txt":"the question of whether to send a thank"},{"t":255.6,"txt":"you note. And so there's a comment that"},{"t":258,"txt":"one of our viewers left and it says to"},{"t":260.1,"txt":"push back a bit. Regardless of your"},{"t":261.8,"txt":"feeling of how an interview goes, it's"},{"t":263.5,"txt":"always a good idea to send a thank you"},{"t":265,"txt":"email afterwards. I've known people who"},{"t":267.1,"txt":"later found out that sending a thank you"},{"t":268.8,"txt":"letter is what made the difference that"},{"t":270.6,"txt":"got them hired. Even if it doesn't, at"},{"t":272.6,"txt":"least it shows professionalism and"},{"t":274.4,"txt":"courtesy."},{"t":275.2,"txt":">> I agree. I mean, these are like really"},{"t":276.9,"txt":"great [music] points. It does show"},{"t":278.1,"txt":"professionalism. It does show courtesy."},{"t":280.1,"txt":">> There's been people who I've [music]"},{"t":281.8,"txt":"interviewed for roles cuz roles under"},{"t":284.1,"txt":"our team are like hot commodity and"},{"t":286.7,"txt":"they've just sent really thoughtful"},{"t":288.2,"txt":"emails to me and I'm like, I do want to"},{"t":290.6,"txt":"hire you. You're very nice."},{"t":292.8,"txt":">> And you can write really well and that"},{"t":295,"txt":"is a key skill for the type of work that"},{"t":298.3,"txt":"we're in."},{"t":299,"txt":">> Yes. And there's also been people who I"},{"t":301.1,"txt":"just hired even if they didn't send a"},{"t":302.9,"txt":"thank you message. So it's like it"},{"t":304.9,"txt":"depends."},{"t":305.7,"txt":">> Yeah. [music] I mean usually it's not a"},{"t":307.5,"txt":"make orb breakak kind of moment, but it"},{"t":309.7,"txt":"is a special touch."},{"t":311,"txt":">> If you're liking our job search advice,"},{"t":313.4,"txt":"make sure you like and subscribe, but"},{"t":315.4,"txt":"also drop a question or [music] any"},{"t":317.3,"txt":"topic you'd like us to cover in future"},{"t":319.6,"txt":"episodes. That's it. Bye."}],"words":[{"t":6.56,"w":"So"},{"t":6.799,"w":"with"},{"t":7.04,"w":"tell"},{"t":7.2,"w":"me"},{"t":7.44,"w":"about"},{"t":7.52,"w":"yourself"},{"t":8.24,"w":"when"},{"t":8.48,"w":"you're"},{"t":8.639,"w":"thinking"},{"t":8.88,"w":"about"},{"t":9.12,"w":"what"},{"t":9.36,"w":"is"},{"t":9.44,"w":"the"},{"t":9.599,"w":"best"},{"t":9.76,"w":"way"},{"t":9.92,"w":"to"},{"t":10.08,"w":"answer"},{"t":10.32,"w":"this"},{"t":10.559,"w":"question"},{"t":11.2,"w":"one"},{"t":11.44,"w":"format"},{"t":11.84,"w":"that"},{"t":12.08,"w":"I"},{"t":12.32,"w":"always"},{"t":12.559,"w":"lean"},{"t":12.88,"w":"towards"},{"t":13.44,"w":"which"},{"t":13.679,"w":"is"},{"t":13.84,"w":"going"},{"t":14,"w":"to"},{"t":14.16,"w":"be"},{"t":14.32,"w":"the"},{"t":14.41,"w":"[music]"},{"t":14.639,"w":"present"},{"t":15